        "id": 188223,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-20T08:47:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’d like to be able to turn Advanced on and off, or at least change it from side to side, or for some team villains and not others.</p>\n<p>The Ennead, for instance; I think they’re perfect with the front side on advanced, but the back side not.</p>\n<p>Similarly, I’d like to be able to have Proletariat keep multiplying, for instance, and keep Friction’s DR 1, but not have Ermine constantly destroying cards.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:14:09.977Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
